91 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[528.426 406.68 550.426 428.68]/Subtype/Text/M(D:20250105180429Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(Regulation of spatial arrangement and therefore movement thus leads to the exacerbation of the malaria epidemic, illustrating, again, how the imposition of state power on a landscape and who can \(or cannot\) traverse it thus shapes a variety of things.\n\nInterestingly, when we think of malaria or mosquitoes, I think we tend to think of them as natural forces that affect human society. Here, we can see things are more complex than that.)/NM(Zotero-8X3PSEF3)/Zotero:Key(8X3PSEF3)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/F 4/C[1 0.8313725490196079 0]/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 92 0 R>>>>endobj
